WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.430
<i>Astral is still alive!</i>

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:08.070
<i>Believing that, I entered the Dimension Teleportation Device in order to set off to the Astral World.</i>

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>All of a sudden another Barian got in the way!</i>

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.440
<i>And the installation energy hasn't been fully charged yet!</i>

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:19.300
<i>In order to set me off, Kaito and V began a Duel against the Barian.</i>

00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.630
I know he Summoned his Number!

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.840
Where in the world is it?

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.300
My Monster's right in front of you!

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:43.270
Maybe your bad eyes just can't see my Monster, ka?

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.700
<i>What's with that dizzyness just now?</i>

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:48.970
What wrong, Kaito?

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.620
No, it's nothing...

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:55.780
<i>It's almost time, ka!</i>

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.050
Shit...!

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.800
Where the heck is the guy's Monster? Where is it?

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.660
I see it!

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:06.710
I see it! Over there!

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.040
Hmmm...?

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:11.760
Look! Right above his left shoulder! Look!

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:16.070
Wow, it is! Is that a Number?

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.890
It's tiny!

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.010
So you finally see it?

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:24.980
This guy's No. 2 Shadow Mosquito the Ninja of Science!

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:28.730
I set one card face-down! Turn end!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.360
My turn. Draw!

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:35.890
<i>A Number with zero Attack Points...</i>

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:39.660
<i>It must have a frightening effect hidden away...</i>

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:45.450
<i>But you won't know the tone of a bell until you ring it!</i>

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:49.250
I use Dyson Sphere to attack Shadow Mosquito!

00:01:56.080 --> 00:01:58.430
He's gonna deal him a huge amount of damage!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:05.020
Naive! So naive!

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:09.520
I activated Shadow Mosquito's effect just now!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.940
By detaching one Overlay Unit, Shadow Mosquito

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:16.360
can make all Battle Damage zero

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.110
and negate a Monster's destruction!

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:25.910
<i>But Shadow Mosquito's true terror...heh...has only just begun!</i>

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.630
<i>So it has an effect that reduces Battle Damage to zero?</i>

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:32.170
<i>No, that can't possibly be all.</i>

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.130
<i>What is that guy planning?</i>

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:39.340
I set two cards face-down to end my turn.

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.300
Kotori, what's the status of
 the energy being installed into the machine?

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:47.310
Huh? Uh... It's at 72% right now.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:52.900
So that means you need more time to send your little friend off, ka?

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:57.130
My turn! Draw!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.030
Kaito?!

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.490
I'm fine.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:10.660
<i>Is the poison I injected into him finally working, ka?</i>

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:41.720
<i>Being best friends doesn't mean we always were</i>

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.770
<i>That's pretty much true</i>

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:52.230
<i>I found you during our serious battles</i>

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.780
<i>The other me inside myself</i>

00:03:55.780 --> 00:04:00.660
<i>Awakening from within the conflict</i>

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:07.000
<i>A turn for a chance! Seize it! Draw!</i>

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:10.210
<i>Duel! Dualism!</i>

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.090
<i>These cards are polished to fit each other</i>

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:17.720
<i>My fated opponent is my heart reflected through the mirror</i>

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.800
<i>And if we end up with a "tie" in the end,</i>

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:29.270
<i>when we fall, all covered with mud, we'll praise each other</i>

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:50.180
<i>So Shadow Mosquito's a Number that negates Battle Damage to zero by detaching an Overlay Unit.</i>

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:51.640
"Kaito in Frenzy: The Ultimate Showdown Between Mentor and Apprentice!!"

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.060
<i>In that case...</i>

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.520
It'll just take longer to hunt!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:58.520
I use Galaxy-Eyes to attack Shadow Mosquito!

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:02.360
At this moment, Galaxy-Eyes' effect activates!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.740
I'll Banish him from the field along with the opposing Monster he's battling with!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:11.490
Then, after the battle, both Monsters return to the field,

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:14.250
and if the opponent is an Xyz Monster,

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.710
all of its Overlay Units are sent to the Graveyard!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:20.630
Why?!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.420
Galaxy-Eyes' effect didn't activate?!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:27.890
Stupid! Galaxy-Eyes had already been poisoned!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:31.350
A poison called a Hallucination Counter!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.100
Hallucination Counter?

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:39.060
When I used Shadow Mosquito's Overlay Unit during V's turn,

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.860
I didn't just negate the Battle Damage from the attacking Monster,

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:50.200
it also places one Hallucination Counter on a Monster on the field, ka!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:57.920
and Shadow Mosquito can't be destroyed in battle by a Monster with a Hallucination Counter

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:03.710
and the Battle Damage is negated, with the opposing player taking the same damage instead!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.720
Since this Duel is of the Battle Royale rules,

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.930
I can now damage either one of you as I see fit, ka!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:15.100
After Galaxy-Eyes battled with Shadow Mosquito, the damage is worth 3000!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.640
If this continues, one of them will...

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:24.820
Dyson Sphere is a stupidly giant jerk, and I really can't stand that!

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:29.950
So, V, you'll be taking the damage!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.750
I activate the Continuous Trap, Micron Force!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:42.630
It halves the original Attack Points of all face-up Monsters on the field!

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.010
V!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:51.970
Tch!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.560
Chris, are you all-

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:01.400
<i>Why...? What is...?</i>

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.030
I set two cards face-down and end...my turn.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:15.330
<i>Looks like the real poison I injected Kaito with earlier on is working well!</i>

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.660
What's wrong, Kaito? Pull yourself together!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:22.880
This Duel is no ordinary Duel, as you know!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.210
Of course I...know that.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:32.640
Then you know exactly who needs to be defeated, right, ka?

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:38.140
Yeah! I'll defeat you no matter what!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.100
You're going to defeat me, ka?

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:43.560
What in the world are you talking about, Kaito?

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.520
If you think you can, go ahead and try, ka!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:53.490
I won't just try! I'll beat both you and your annoying Number straight into Hell!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:55.240
Kaito...!

00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:57.700
What's Kaito going on about?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.160
What's he mean by suddenly declaring he'll beat V?

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:08.170
<i>Pestering successful! The poison I injected Kaito with has the ability to cause one to see hallucinations.</i>

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:12.720
<i>Called "Scientific Ninja Art:
 Dreamy Hallucination Technique"!</i>

00:08:13.840 --> 00:08:16.550
My turn! I draw, ka!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:21.060
I Summon Army Mosquito Blood Commando!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:28.070
And when Shadow Mosquito is on my field,

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.480
I can send Blood Commando to the Graveyard,

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:36.240
I can then inject one of the opponent's Monsters with a Hallucination Counter!

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:39.620
Eat this, Dyson Sphere!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.540
Now your Monster will do as I please, ka!

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.550
And then a Magic Card from my hand!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:53.220
Mosquito School Ninja Art: Mosquito Flame Emission activates!

00:08:53.670 --> 00:09:03.730
This card deals 600 points of damage to each player controlling a Monster infected by a Hallucination Counter, ka!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:09.020
Trap, activate! Elastic Space!

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:14.570
When I take damage from a card effect, it negates that damage,

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:17.490
and deals the inflicted damage to the opponent's Life Points!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.870
Now take your 1200 damage!

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.380
Chris...! Trap, activate! Exchange Power!

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:35.670
It takes the amount of damage inflicted by a card effect

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:40.010
and by decreasing the Attack Power of a Monster on my field by the same amount,

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.020
I negate the damage.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.100
What?!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:52.530
Whew, that sure was close! I owe you one, Kaito!

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:56.400
He reduced Galaxy-Eyes' Attack Power in order to help the enemy?!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.160
Kaito's definitely acting weird!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.700
Right, he's definitely acting weird!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:08.670
Thanks to the poison I injected into him long before this match began!

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:10.380
Did you say poison?!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:15.130
But you didn't even have the time to inject Kaito with the poison!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:18.050
When you guys first came here,

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:20.890
the trap had already been set, ka!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:23.930
Thanks to a harmless little insect bite!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.350
I get it! It was back then...!

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.310
Took you long enough to notice!
 Girls won't like you if you don't pay attention!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:38.030
<i>Galaxy-Eyes was supposed to be one of the keys needed for us to win this Duel.</i>

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:42.280
<i>But Kaito's been poisoned and is now caught in a hallucination!</i>

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:45.910
<i>I must break him out of that hallucination!</i>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:11:02.010
<i>Enough already, Chris! You guys have been Dueling nonstop day and night for the past week!</i>

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:06.140
<i>Not yet! Trap, activate! Blasting the Ruins!</i>

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:16.360
<i>Stand up, Kaito! This Duel still isn't over!</i>

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:19.820
<i>What's wrong?! I'm telling you to stand up!</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:25.490
<i>Chris! Even as an experiment to push a Duelist to the brink to awaken their latent survival instincts,</i>

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:26.870
<i>this is going way too far!</i>

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:30.830
<i>It is not! Even if you have only one Life Point remaining,</i>

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:33.540
<i>even if your heart stops beating,</i>

00:11:33.540 --> 00:11:36.710
<i>a True Duelist continues fighting until their last breath!</i>

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:40.880
<i>But if this continues, Kaito's life truly will be in danger!</i>

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:45.970
<i>Then so be it! If he falls now, it means Kaito wasn't man enough to begin with!</i>

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.480
<i>But when he overcomes this and stands up,</i>

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:59.190
<i>after having it burned into one cell at a time, what remains will be the strong will to Duel as a True Duelist!</i>

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:02.860
<i>Now let's go, Kaito!</i>

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.990
<i>In order to bring Kaito back to his senses...</i>

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.410
My turn! Draw!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:17.040
I use Dyson Sphere to attack Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:21.220
Eh?! Why is V attacking Kaito?!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:26.470
Kaito's only got 2000 Life Points! If this attack goes through, he'll be wiped out!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:34.480
What's wrong, V? Did you lose your mind when you ran out of ideas, ka?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:41.820
Kaito! Will this be your end, ka?

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.780
<i>Awaken it, Kaito!</i>

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:51.450
Your instincts as a Duelist!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.590
<i>That's it, Kaito! That's all I needed!</i>

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:08.390
That's all I needed.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:21.150
Kaito!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:24.030
Did it go through, ka?!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.830
What?!

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.040
But why?! Why does he still have Life remaining?!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:44.510
That's because I activated the Trap Card, Prevent Reborn!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:49.510
When an Attack Position Monster on my field is destroyed,

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:52.560
this card decreases the Battle Damage by 1000 points!

00:13:52.810 --> 00:13:55.230
You finally woke up, Kaito?!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:58.650
How...did you break through the hallucination?!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:04.610
My survival instincts as a Duelist have been forced into my immune system,

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:09.030
and my blazing hot blood neutralized
 the poison by burning it to nothing.

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:14.870
<i>Like hell</i> that can actually happen!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:19.830
How dare you make a mockery out of my Duel with your dirty tricks!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.800
You'll pay for that sin tens of thousand times over!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:27.010
I activate the other effect of Prevent Reborn!

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:30.930
One Monster that was destroyed in battle

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.970
is Special Summoned from the Graveyard!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.230
Revive, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:43.190
And the Monster revived through the effect of Prevent Reborn

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.820
has its Hallucination Counter sent to the Graveyard!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.610
I've now buried all your silly little traps you set up!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.330
He did it! Now they can fight back!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:55.740
Whew...

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:59.500
I was wondering what would happen if he didn't wake up.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.170
There's no way that would have happened.

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:05.250
Kaito is a True Duelist I raised myself.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.760
There's no way that attack wouldn't have woken him up.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:14.470
<i>These guys... How... How are they so awesome?</i>

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.560
<i>They're bound by bonds built off of absolute trust!</i>

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:21.230
<i>But I also had...</i>

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.980
<i>...a bond with him so strong it wouldn't lose to anyone!</i>

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:30.780
Shit...! Astral!

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:34.870
I set two cards face-down! Turn end!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:37.370
My turn! Draw!

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:41.750
I use Galaxy-Eyes to attack Shadow Mosquito!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.960
When Galaxy-Eyes battles,

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:49.010
it Banishes itself along with one of the opponent's Monsters!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:55.050
And all of your Overlay Units are sent to the Graveyard!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:59.430
Shadow Mosquito's Overlay Units...!

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.020
And the Monsters Banished with this effect

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.270
return to the field after the battle!

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.770
And when Galaxy-Eyes returns to the field,

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.650
it takes one Overlay Unit from the Graveyard,

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.990
and increases its Attack Power by 500 points!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.870
And now that Shadow Mosquito has lost its Overlay Units,

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:22.040
it's no different from a mosquito with its wings torn off!

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.920
You won't! Trap, activate!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:27.750
Mosquito School Ninja Art: Mosquito Repellent Flash!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:33.720
This card activates by targeting an Xyz Monster with no Overlay Units!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:37.800
It then Banishes all the Army Mosquito Monsters in my Graveyard

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:42.140
and raises its Attack Power by 1000 for each!

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:46.690
I have a total of four Army Mosquito Monsters in my Graveyard!

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:51.360
Thus, its Attack Power raises by 4000 points, ka!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:03.160
So you really were hiding another trump card.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.630
Hey, you! I thought you hated gigantic Monsters!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.170
Yeah, I sure do hate 'em! I despise them!

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:17.590
And that's why I'll have the two of them disappear in an instant!

00:17:17.590 --> 00:17:20.720
I activate the other effect of Mosquito Repellent Flash!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:24.690
It Banishes the Monster targeted by this effect at the end of the turn,

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:29.020
and deals its Attack Power as damage to the both of you!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.230
As soon as this turn comes to an end,

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.280
you guys will meet your end, ka!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.450
Kaito! V!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.120
Stay put, Yuma!

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.580
You mustn't move right now!

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.660
But...!

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.620
Have you forgotten, Yuma?

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:52.880
The reason we're fighting here is so we can send you off to the Astral World.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:58.010
If we don't pull it off, victory will be pointless!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.050
What are you guys babbling on about?!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:06.100
Mosquito Repellent Flash already activated, meaning your Battle Phase already ended!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:09.520
Your destiny is to be blown away miserably, ka!

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:13.150
Even if Yuma Tsukumo manages to get to the Astral World,

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:19.490
I'll just destroy that machine to ensure he never makes it back to this world again, ka!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:23.950
It seems you've been trapped in one of your own hallucinations.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:28.210
I'm about to wake you up from it. Prepare yourself!

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.170
I activate the Continuous Spell, Eternal Magic!

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:37.800
This card takes on the effect of one of the opponent's Continuous Spells from their Graveyard!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:43.140
I choose Hologram Projection from Chris' Graveyard!

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:47.770
Hologram Projection chooses one Monster on the field

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:50.600
and treats it as the same Monster!

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:53.320
I choose Galaxy-Eyes!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:56.280
Galaxy-Eyes split into two!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:19:00.160
What you created with Hologram Projection is nothing but a cheap imitation in the end!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.240
It can't be used for an attack,

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:06.540
When it's targeted by an attack or a card effect, it's automatically destroyed, ka!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.080
Exactly right!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.120
That's why we'll be using this!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:14.170
Trap, activate! Power Analyze!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:18.340
With this card, the Attack Power of one Machine-Type Monster on the field

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:23.640
becomes equal to the Attack Power of one Monster on the field!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:29.100
I make Dyson Sphere's Attack Power equal to Galaxy-Eyes!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:33.520
I then activate a Trap! Paradox Synthesize!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:40.820
This card sends one Xyz Monster I control and one Level Five or higher Monster my opponent controls to the Graveyard,

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:45.910
and gives their total Attack Points to one Monster on the field!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:47.580
You can't!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.540
I release Dyson Sphere and Hologram Projection!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:57.750
This adds their total 8000 Attack Points to Galaxy-Eyes!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.680
It's actually got 12000 Attack Points?!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.520
It's huge!

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.230
B-But your battle already ended!

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:19.360
Even if you raise its Attack Points, it's no use, ka!

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.150
Are you positive?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:21.820
What?!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:26.740
I activate the Magic Card, Miracle Galaxy, from my hand!

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:32.750
During a turn in which I took no damage,

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:37.590
I can target one Monster on my field and battle with it once again!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.960
Wh-What did you say, ka?!

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.220
Your repentance isn't even worth hearing!

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:48.180
I use Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon to attack Shadow Mosquito!

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:50.930
Burn straight into the fires of Hell!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:54.600
Photon Stream of Destruction!!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:02.860
So this is how it ends, ka?!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.410
They won!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:08.950
You did it, Kaito!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.700
Kaito... That was splendid.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.540
It's all thanks to you, Chris.

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:18.880
The energy installation reached 100%!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.640
The time for your journey has come.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:32.220
Go on, Yuma! You better bring Astral back at all costs!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:33.230
Yeah!

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.320
You better... You better come back!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.920
That's a promise... okay?

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:05.090
Just you wait for me, Astral!
 I'm gonna definitely bring you back with me!

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:07.680
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.820
<i>Is it the world that's boring?</i>

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:26.360
<i>Or maybe you're the one who's not gettin' serious?</i>

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:27.570
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:28.990
<i>Do I understand?</i>

00:22:29.200 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>Already got my answers</i>

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:34.370
<i>Once you start movin', you ain't stoppin'</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.910
<i>I go on thinkin' even while losin'.</i>

00:22:36.910 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Do you understand?</i>

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:39.040
<i>I understand!</i>

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:42.420
<i>Our formula for reversal's already gathered</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:44.750
<i>You afraid it ain't comin' true?</i>

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:47.880
<i>I gotta 'least give it a try</i>

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:50.090
<i>Ain't no problem if they say I'm borin'</i>

00:22:50.090 --> 00:22:53.100
<i>True failure's when we stop movin'</i>

00:22:53.260 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Come on! Ga, ga, ga, guys & dolls</i>

00:22:55.060 --> 00:22:56.430
<i>Go, go, go, go my way</i>

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.310
<i>Oh, oh, oh, over ray</i>

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:02.610
<i>Door's always open for you</i>

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:07.690
<i>Bring your power forth and go way, go way</i>

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:12.950
<i>And tears are no way, no way</i>

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:18.330
<i>With all my strength, pave way, go way</i>

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:19.540
<i>I understand!</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:23.670
<i>Got all the courage here</i>

00:23:23.670 --> 00:23:25.840
<i>You ought to understand!</i>

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:28.050
<i>Go way, go way</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:45.230
Within the tunnel of light, I suddenly ran into a giant pillar of blue light.

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:49.610
As soon as I arrive, I suddenly find myself under attack!

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.320
Just wait a minute!

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.910
I'm not an enemy!

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:55.160
Yuma, return home safely!

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.790
You're Rainbow Kuriboh!

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.240
The time for my awakening?!

00:23:58.240 --> 00:24:00.160
You're Astral?!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:02.750
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:05.460
"Deity of the Holy Azure Land - Eliphas the Radiant"

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.550
I'm gonna take Astral back!
